abstract: "DTQEM v12.1 is an open-source, high-precision simulation framework for two-qubit entanglement under thermal decoherence, magnetic fields, and quantum gates. It solves the Lindblad master equation exactly using Liouvillian exponentiation, offers real-time visualisation of interference fringes, Bloch vectors, density matrices, and provides inverse calibration from experimental visibility data. The model passes all physical benchmarks (dephasing, relaxation, entropy increase) with machine precision and includes a unique testable prediction (V = D at θ = 90°)."
